{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139228.mp3","text":"No çakêt zaf ro to ame"}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139230.mp3","text":"Hetê ilmê zonu ra qe jü delil çino ke Zazaki zonê do Kurdki bo."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139236.mp3","text":"Ey karê xo qedênay bi."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139252.mp3","text":"Her kes be derdê xuyo."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139261.mp3","text":"Ma her ca de vanê"}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139482.mp3","text":"O yeno"}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40154482.mp3","text":"Lajek rusna mekteb"}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139408.mp3","text":"Çehar sey"}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139489.mp3","text":"O nêwazeno."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139423.mp3","text":"Ez işliga xo cênu pıra."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40158935.mp3","text":"Cew be genım ra sanenê pê, pia rinê ra."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40139479.mp3","text":"Ê, mesın dosenê."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40154513.mp3","text":"Bıwere, xo mırd bıkere."}
{"audio":"zza/unknown/zza_u_40158947.mp3","text":"Qısawate meke."}
